- outputs/summary.json: the statistic, CI, p-value, secondary metrics, final K and stage timings.

Statistic. Per task, compute student, teacher and uncompiled-base accuracies on the 60 test items. The statistic is the mean over tasks of (student - teacher), with a 95% CI from 10,000 paired bootstrap resamples over tasks.

Secondary metrics:
- counts of tasks where student > teacher, student = teacher, and student < teacher;
- inheritance: among items the student gets wrong, the fraction the teacher also gets wrong (pooled over items and macro-averaged over tasks);
- repair: among items the teacher gets wrong, the fraction the student gets right;
- compile gain (student - base);
- Spearman rho between student and teacher accuracy per task.

